  "info": {
    "title": "Ambient",
    "author": "Atomik Rack factory",
    "notes": "A slow, open ambient piece in A minor at 68 BPM: long suspended chords on a layered pad, a deep drone that ducks from a soft heartbeat kick, a few quiet drum hits, a slow marimba spread and a drifting texture, with a huge hall and a tape echo. Almost nothing happens in the first bars: let the pad breathe, then add your own layers. Try a slow filter sweep on the pad, or stretch the break."
  },
